    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Upstage Solar is an API only, text in and text out family. All three catalog versions support reasoning, and none publish open weights, so you cannot self host. Context windows run from 131072 to 524288 tokens, with maximum output from 117964 to 131072 tokens, which suits long documents and long generated answers. Pricing is low per million tokens, from $0.05 input and $0.2 output on Solar Mini 4 up to $0.15 input and $0.6 output on Solar Pro 3, so cost scales with volume rather than access. The facts suggest the family fits high volume text and reasoning work over large inputs, where API use is acceptable. Limits are the text only modalities, no open weights, and the higher per token cost of the older Pro 3 tier.",
